        <link:loc xlink:href="#f-1065" xlink:label="f-1065_lbl" xlink:type="locator" />
        <link:loc xlink:href="#f-1199" xlink:label="f-1199_lbl" xlink:type="locator" />
        <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="f-110_lbl" order="1" xlink:to="ft-110_46942_lbl" />
        <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="f-116_lbl" order="1" xlink:to="ft-116_46943_lbl" />
        <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="f-120_lbl" order="1" xlink:to="ft-120_46944_lbl" />
        <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="f-898_lbl" order="0" xlink:to="ft-898_47292_lbl" />
        <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="f-1065_lbl" order="0" xlink:to="ft-1065_47290_lbl" />
        <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="f-1199_lbl" order="0" xlink:to="ft-1199_47397_lbl" />
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-110_46942_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p>Energy Transfer LP owns 100% of ET CC Holdings LLC.</p><p>ET CC Holdings LLC owns 87.7% of Permian Express Partners LLC.</p><p>ET CC Holdings LLC owns 60% and Permian Express Partners LLC owns 40% of Bakken Holdings Company LLC.</p><p>Bakken Holdings Company LLC owns 51% of Bakken Pipeline Investments LLC.</p><p>Bakken Pipeline Investments LLC owns 100% of Dakota Access Holdings LLC.</p><p>Dakota Access Holdings LLC owns 75% of Dakota Access, LLC.</p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-116_46943_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p>MarEn Bakken Company LLC owns 49% of Bakken Pipeline Investments, LLC. </p><p>Bakken Pipeline Investments LLC owns 100% of Dakota Access Holdings, LLC. </p><p>Dakota Access Holdings, LLC owns 75% of Dakota Access, LLC.</p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-120_46944_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p>Mid-Point Pipeline, L.L.C. owns approx. 12.3% of Permian Express Partners LLC. </p><p>Permian Express Partners LLC owns 40% of Bakken Holdings Company LLC. </p><p>Bakken Holdings Company LLC owns 51% of Bakken Pipeline Investments LLC. </p><p>Bakken Pipeline Investments LLC owns 100% of Dakota Access Holdings, LLC. </p><p>Dakota Access Holdings, LLC owns 75% of Dakota Access, LLC.</p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-898_47292_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto">Schedule Page 212 Line No.: 47 Column: g</p><p style="margin: 0; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto">$1.8MM of transferred ETCO Optimization projects transferred to DAPL in Q42025.</p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1065_47290_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>Other Adjustments of $24,205,494 reflect an asset reclassification that resulted in changes to the associated depreciation expense.</p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1199_47397_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p style="margin: 0 0 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">The cost of service results were calculated using the Cost of Service Model.This Model calculates cost of service using the Trended Original Cost methodology promulgated by the FERC in Opinion No. 154-B, 31 FERC 61,377 (1985), as modified and clarified by subsequent rulings. </span></span></p></link:footnote>
    </link:footnoteLink>
